        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>本地人排队都要吃重庆美食</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #f4f4f1;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      color: #414149;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 12px 25px 8px 40px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 25%, rgba(255,255,255,.9), transparent 26%),\n        linear-gradient(100deg, #f8f8f5 0%, #fff 46%, #fafaf6 100%);\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 9px 69px;\n      color: #35333b;\n      font-family: SimHei, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      line-height: 34px;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .entry {\n      position: relative;\n      margin: 0 0 11px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 21px;\n    }\n\n    .entry.compact {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .check {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: -22px;\n      top: -2px;\n      color: #ff38ac;\n      font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      line-height: 1;\n      transform: rotate(-9deg);\n    }\n\n    .heading-line {\n      height: 21px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .label {\n      display: inline-block;\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      padding: 0 3px;\n      color: #42432f;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 19px;\n    }\n\n    .label::before {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: -1;\n      right: -3px;\n      bottom: 1px;\n      left: -3px;\n      height: 15px;\n      border-radius: 48% 31% 47% 35%;\n      background: rgba(206, 242, 69, .76);\n      content: \"\";\n      transform: rotate(-1deg);\n    }\n\n    .stars {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin-left: 7px;\n      color: #ff25a6;\n      font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", cursive;\n      font-size: 22px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      vertical-align: -2px;\n      transform: rotate(-4deg);\n    }\n\n    .text {\n      margin: 0;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .underline {\n      border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 50, 164, .68);\n      padding-bottom: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .annotation {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 77px;\n      right: 123px;\n      color: #ff3ca9;\n      font-family: KaiTi, STKaiti, cursive;\n      font-size: 19px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      transform: rotate(-8deg);\n    }\n\n    .annotation::after {\n      display: block;\n      width: 123px;\n      height: 7px;\n      margin-top: -2px;\n      border-bottom: 2px solid #ff3ca9;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      content: \"\";\n      transform: rotate(3deg);\n    }\n\n    .pink-stroke {\n      display: inline-block;\n      color: #ff36a8;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>本地人排队都要吃重庆美食</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"entry compact\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"heading-line\">\n        <span class=\"label\">马房湾66号江湖菜</span>\n        <span class=\"stars\">★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text\">非常出名的<span class=\"underline\">重庆江湖菜</span>，味道超级地道，推荐江湖第一蒸，辣子鸡，招牌血旺等，环境是七八十年代怀旧风，集颜值与味道于一身的江湖菜</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"annotation\">重庆江湖菜top1</div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry compact\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"heading-line\">\n        <span class=\"label\">洋马儿火锅</span>\n        <span class=\"stars\">★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text\">一家藏得很深的火锅，很正宗的九宫格火锅，九宫格上面放着鹅卵石，虾滑、毛肚超好吃</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"heading-line\">\n        <span class=\"label\">君之薇火锅</span>\n        <span class=\"stars\">★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text\">这是一家藏在半山腰上的火锅店已经有 20 多年历史了，味道还是那么霸道，重点是还便宜，性价比超高，冰汤圆和卤味系列的菜是我的最爱，他们家包子还超好吃</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry compact\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"heading-line\">\n        <span class=\"label\">六指烧烤</span>\n        <span class=\"stars\">★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text\">烧烤店也能排队排到心累，碳火烤出来的烧烤真的太香了，特别喜欢吃烤豆干，里面放一些他们家的泡萝卜，好吃到哭</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"heading-line\">\n        <span class=\"label\">沈姐烤鱼</span>\n        <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text\">很正宗的<span class=\"underline\">重庆万州烤鱼</span>，就在重庆大学 B 区，烤鱼有多种味道，最爱吃的还是香辣味，性价比很高，一大条鱼才几十块钱的样子</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry compact\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"heading-line\">\n        <span class=\"label\">鬼斗糕老烧饼</span>\n        <span class=\"stars\">★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text\">在较场口的梯坎上，在繁华的大都市中，买上一只只卖 5 毛钱的鬼斗糕满满的童年回忆，Q 弹软糯，烧饼也很好吃，价格也很感人！</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"heading-line\">\n        <span class=\"label\">望江楼三鲜砂锅米线</span>\n        <span class=\"stars\">★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text\">虽然比较远，但是贵的是跟度假一样，到这里安静，淳朴！藏在大山上 25 年的砂锅米线，<span class=\"underline\">一排灶孔可同时煮很多砂锅</span>，每一位材料非常丰富，鲜香四溢！</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"heading-line\">\n        <span class=\"label\">食济粮重庆特产严选超市</span>\n        <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text\">重庆买特产的好去处，是连锁店，正规不会被坑，他们家的上下城火锅底料还不错，作为本地人都经常买来煮火锅</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"heading-line\">\n        <span class=\"label\">老院子肥肠鸡</span>\n        <span class=\"stars\">★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text\">这家店在老居民楼的坝坝里，每天人都是爆满，他们家的肥肠鸡非常入味，滴着油的肥肠条韧又有弹性，口感很不错</p>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
